---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base current="event-space" title="Events at The Common | Squamish" description="Host a gathering, workshop, or community event at The Common in downtown Squamish. Tell us what you are planning.">
  <header class="page-hd"><div class="wrap"><span class="eyebrow on-dark">Events at The Common</span><h1>Bring your group<br />to The Common.</h1><p>We host workshops, meetups, and community events in downtown Squamish.</p></div></header>
  <section class="section light event-intro"><div class="wrap split"><div><span class="kicker">Plan an event</span><h2>Tell us what you're planning.</h2><p>The Common has hosted workshops, socials, and community gatherings. The main room, kitchen, and courtyard can all be part of an event.</p><p>Send us your preferred date, the number of people, and a short description. We'll confirm the layout, timing, equipment, and price with you.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="mailto:welcome@thecommon.io?subject=Event%20at%20The%20Common">Email us about an event</a></div><img class="photo" src="/img/story/common-event-gathering.jpg" alt="Guests mingling at a gathering inside The Common" loading="lazy" /></div></section>
  <section class="section warm"><div class="wrap event-grid"><article><span class="kicker">Smaller meetings</span><h2>Book a room online.</h2><p>The Small Conference Room, Trailer, and Micro Office each have their own booking page.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/spaces/">See the rooms</a></article><article><span class="kicker">Community groups</span><h2>Planning a local event?</h2><p>The Common has supported nonprofit and community gatherings. Tell us what you're organizing and we'll let you know what is possible.</p><a class="inline-link" href="/community/">Read about our community work</a></article></div></section>
</Base>
<style>.split h2,.event-grid h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,3.5vw,3.2rem);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:.7rem 0 1rem}.split p,.event-grid p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.06rem}.split .btn{margin-top:.6rem}.event-intro{overflow:hidden}.event-intro .split{grid-template-columns:.85fr 1.15fr}.event-intro .photo{width:calc(100% + 4vw);height:570px;aspect-ratio:auto;object-fit:cover;object-position:58% center}.event-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,5vw,5rem)}.event-grid article{border-top:2px solid var(--forest);padding-top:1.5rem}@media(max-width:700px){.event-grid,.event-intro .split{grid-template-columns:1fr}.event-intro .photo{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/3}}</style>
